  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "49",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 49"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "49",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jacob Blesses His Sons",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jacob called for his sons and said: \"Gather around so I can tell you what will happen to you in days to come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Assemble and listen, sons of Jacob;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "listen to your father Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Reuben, you are my firstborn,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "my might, the first sign of my strength,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "excelling in honor, excelling in power.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turbulent as the waters, you will no longer excel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for you went up onto your father's bed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "onto my couch and defiled it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Simeon and Levi are brothers—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "their swords",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "are weapons of violence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me not enter their council,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "let me not join their assembly,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 49:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for they have killed men in their anger",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and hamstrung oxen as they pleased.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cursed be their anger, so fierce,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and their fury, so cruel!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 49:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will scatter them in Jacob",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and disperse them in Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Judah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "your brothers will praise you;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "your hand will be on the neck of your enemies;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "your father's sons will bow down to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are a lion's cub, Judah;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you return from the prey, my son.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 49:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Like a lion he crouches and lies down,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "like a lioness—who dares to rouse him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The scepter will not depart from Judah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nor the ruler's staff from between his feet,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 49:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "until he to whom it belongs",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "shall come",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the obedience of the nations shall be his.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will tether his donkey to a vine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his colt to the choicest branch;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 49:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he will wash his garments in wine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his robes in the blood of grapes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His eyes will be darker than wine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his teeth whiter than milk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Zebulun will live by the seashore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and become a haven for ships;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his border will extend toward Sidon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Issachar is a rawboned",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "donkey",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
