      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 49:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "in the evening he divides the plunder.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All these are the twelve tribes of Israel, and this is what their father said to them when he blessed them, giving each the blessing appropriate to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Death of Jacob",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he gave them these instructions: \"I am about to be gathered to my people. Bury me with my fathers in the cave in the field of Ephron the Hittite,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the cave in the field of Machpelah, near Mamre in Canaan, which Abraham bought along with the field as a burial place from Ephron the Hittite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There Abraham and his wife Sarah were buried, there Isaac and his wife Rebekah were buried, and there I buried Leah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The field and the cave in it were bought from the Hittites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jacob had finished giving instructions to his sons, he drew his feet up into the bed, breathed his last and was gathered to his people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
